window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-167-037aad44b0997201.json"]={sha256:"037aad44b099720132a3df0026e529c84c0eac7b47027b7d468f63f4434100cc",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-807ad3f67411d95d","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9804.3/en","title":"ITU-T G.9804.3: 50G-PON physical media dependent layer","titleEn":"ITU-T G.9804.3: 50G-PON physical media dependent layer","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-167","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-167","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-168","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.3/en"],"title":"PON Ranging：遠近 ONU 時序等化","titleEn":"PON ranging: equalize near and far ONU timing","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學最差裕度需非負；128分光不能因標示50G而被批准。 50g_pon_budget.csv與功率/容量雙軸評估 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 3.9485 與變更 -2.0721 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching worst-case margin must be nonnegative; a50G label does not approve128-way splitting. 50g_pon_budget.csv and separate power/capacity assessment Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 3.9485 and changed -2.0721 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學可配置等化延遲上限180 µs；20 km配置可用，25 km需重新規劃而非任意放寬碰撞判準。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching configurable equalization limit180 µs:20 km works,25 km needs redesign rather than relaxed collision acceptance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可用光預算30 dB、纖路及接頭9 dB、超額2 dB；N=32改128。 名義式 30-9-2-10*log10(32) = 3.9485 dB；變更式 30-9-2-10*log10(128) = -2.0721 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 將N加倍兩次，損耗應增加約6.0206 dB；與逐次1:2級聯獨立核對。","合成群速度2e8 m/s，近端5 km與遠端20 km；變更遠端25 km，近端不變。 名義式 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us；變更式 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 在共同OLT時間軸列發送、往返及補償量，驗證兩ONU的授權參考時刻一致。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic optical allowance30 dB, path/connectors9 dB and excess2 dB; changeN from32 to128. Nominal 30-9-2-10*log10(32) = 3.9485 dB; changed 30-9-2-10*log10(128) = -2.0721 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Two doublings ofN should add about6.0206 dB loss; verify by cascading two1:2 splitters.","Synthetic group velocity2e8 m/s, near ONU5 km and far ONU20 km; change the far route to25 km. Nominal 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us; changed 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Plot transmission, round-trip propagation and equalization on one OLT timeline and verify aligned grant reference times.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-177","referenceUrls":["https://wholesale.orange.com/international/en/news/amitie-further-enriches-the-transatlantic-axis.html"],"title":"Amitié：跨洋服務維護後的備援餘量","titleEn":"Amitié: transatlantic maintenance and spare capacity","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學最差裕度需非負；128分光不能因標示50G而被批准。 50g_pon_budget.csv與功率/容量雙軸評估 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 3.9485 與變更 -2.0721 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching worst-case margin must be nonnegative; a50G label does not approve128-way splitting. 50g_pon_budget.csv and separate power/capacity assessment Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 3.9485 and changed -2.0721 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學最壞單路退出餘量至少0；100通過、120失敗；另外列出端口與登陸點共同依賴。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching worst single-route-loss spare must be nonnegative:100 passes and120 fails; list common port and landing dependencies separately.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可用光預算30 dB、纖路及接頭9 dB、超額2 dB；N=32改128。 名義式 30-9-2-10*log10(32) = 3.9485 dB；變更式 30-9-2-10*log10(128) = -2.0721 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 將N加倍兩次，損耗應增加約6.0206 dB；與逐次1:2級聯獨立核對。","合成三路各80、60、50 Tbit/s，總需求100；退出最大路，需求再增為120 Tbit/s。 名義式 (80+60+50)-80-100 = 10 Tbit/s；變更式 (80+60+50)-80-120 = -10 Tbit/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 枚舉三個單路退出情境，分別計剩餘能力減需求；最大容量路退出應給最小餘量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic optical allowance30 dB, path/connectors9 dB and excess2 dB; changeN from32 to128. Nominal 30-9-2-10*log10(32) = 3.9485 dB; changed 30-9-2-10*log10(128) = -2.0721 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Two doublings ofN should add about6.0206 dB loss; verify by cascading two1:2 splitters.","Synthetic route capacities80,60,50 Tbit/s with100 demand; remove the largest route, then increase demand to120 Tbit/s. Nominal (80+60+50)-80-100 = 10 Tbit/s; changed (80+60+50)-80-120 = -10 Tbit/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate all three single-route removals and compute remaining capacity minus demand; removing the largest should give minimum spare capacity.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-d30e23afc3081aad","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.3/en","title":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","titleEn":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-e13cefa7c7099345","url":"https://wholesale.orange.com/international/en/news/amitie-further-enriches-the-transatlantic-axis.html","title":"AMITIE further enriches the transatlantic axis","titleEn":"AMITIE further enriches the transatlantic axis","publisher":"Orange Wholesale","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
